  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ISG - Global Conference Food Systems</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Following the momentum of transforming the food system from the UN Summit, the year 2023 will be the year to review and evaluate the transformation process. Accordingly, the 4th Global Conference of the One Planet Network&#x2019;s Sustainable Food Systems Program in Vietnam will review the system to minimize disruptions to global supply chains and overcome current financial and price crises, including food, energy, and increasingly use of fertilizers, contributing to the achievement of the Sustainable Development Goals.

Oxfam in Vietnam in partnership with International Cooperation Department (Ministry of Agriculture and Rural Development of Vietnam) to implement this specific event in accordance with the objective of financial support request, strategic activities to be carried out with expected outputs and impact as stated in the Concept Note in the spirit of transparency and accountability</narrative>
  </description>
